  "label": "American Industrialization",
  "description": "The period of American industrialization in the late 19th and early 20th centuries involved rapid urbanization, the rise of factories, and the growth of labor movements. The top image, with its silhouette of a person in a helmet against a cityscape, can be interpreted as a symbol of industrial labor or urban workers, possibly representing the harsh conditions of factory work or the sacrifices of workers during this era. This context is necessary to understand the potential emotional weight of the image as part of 'American history.'",
